{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvabhe86ga5iwNLcVpkU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: plan to retire the integration and help the four accounts migrate. Talk to them, but not to decide whether to rebuild.**\n\n**The cost doesn't fit the usage.** Four accounts is 0.13% of the base. A rebuild costs about 30 engineer-days, and you'd still be maintaining a niche integration afterward. You already spend about 24 engineer-days a year keeping it alive. That's roughly 54 engineer-days in the first year, or about 13 per account. Only a few things could justify that:\n- These four bring in an unusually large share of revenue, or are strategic accounts that would leave without it.\n- A contract commits you to supporting this provider.\n- There's evidence other customers are about to adopt the provider (unlikely if it's an older provider).\n\n**Check internal data before calling anyone.** Look at each account's revenue, renewal date, contract terms, how much they actually use the integration (daily or once?), and whether they also use your other email integrations. This takes hours and may settle the question.\n\n**Interviews as framed will mislead you.** Ask customers whether you should rebuild a feature they use and they'll say yes, because it costs them nothing. Use the calls to plan their move instead: what they depend on, which supported provider or export path works for them, and what help they need.\n\n**Timeline:** Decide within about two weeks. Give customers at least three months' notice, which fits inside the five-month window. Keep maintenance to the minimum until shutdown.\n\n**When to rebuild:** Only if the data shows that losing these accounts would cost clearly more than about 54 engineer-days. Even then, first check whether a cheaper option, like a generic connector or a custom service deal, would keep them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3604,"cache_read_input_tokens":4609,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3604},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fd6ded73-8743-40e9-8ddf-936d5319bbb6","uuid":"8a7af683-6811-44e0-ac9d-9799bd6d8323","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:07:41.718Z","request_id":"req_011CfvabhPym59eZZNGm2wMG"}
